    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03a926e34a9c4646312cfb9d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然感觉她还不大情愿，但还是点了点头。\r\n看来姑且也是认可了我这训练员的存在呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "05e19521de0af2c39f8fa56470d1e2cddee61d605880444b1d24af2595807b22",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
