    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37c94872225c3b1e5738009a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "喂，你干嘛一脸傻笑啊。\r\n在想什么奇怪的事情的话……\r\n我可要踹你了啊……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "79f3b5e9b3b6e6c662dd2a47bdffc68a63b38048c992718475d9b7aeae5b1194",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1050/storytimeline_501050513.json",
      "json_path": [
